sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant H as HN Scout
    participant W as Web Researcher
    participant R as Article Reader
    participant Wr as Writer
    participant Cr as Critic
    U->>C: query (0 s)
    Note over C: Turn 1: plan 4 sub-questions
    par T1 and T2 in parallel
        C->>H: task T1 (HN threads)
        C->>W: task T2 (recent articles)
    end
    H-->>C: success: top thread + comments
    W-->>C: success: Phoronix, Spiceworks (E1, E2)
    Note over C: Turn 2 (41 s): read the two key sources
    par T3 and T4 in parallel
        C->>R: task T3: read E1
        C->>R: task T4: read E2
    end
    R-->>C: success x2 (E1, E2 now read in full)
    Note over C: Turn 3 (70 s): draft
    C->>Wr: brief
    Wr->>Cr: draft v1
    Cr-->>Wr: critique: 5 issues
    Cr-->>C: verdict REVISE 6/10
    Note over C: Turn 4 (93 s): research the critic's issues
    par T5 and T6 in parallel
        C->>W: task T5: maintainers' statements
        C->>H: task T6: further threads
    end
    W-->>C: partial
    H-->>C: partial
    Note over C: four more sources, E4–E7
    Note over C: Turn 5 (174 s): revise
    C->>Wr: brief: fix the issues
    Wr->>Cr: draft v2
    Cr-->>C: verdict REVISE 6/10, 3 issues
    C-->>U: turn limit reached: v2, accepted with issues (199 s)
